    "description": "<p>Add a Name input field to the new Partner creation flow. Users cannot input the Partner name today when they create a new record.</p><h2>Implementation Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>Add a Name field to the new Partner quick-create or record creation flow.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Make the Name field visible and required at creation time.</p></li></ul><h2>Notes</h2><ul><li><p>The same ask exists for Operator. It is noted as a companion item in BUILD-264 but is not built there either.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>This overlaps with BUILD-269 (mandatory fields on Partner, which also lists Name). Build both together if convenient.</p></li></ul><h2>Source</h2><p>Emily Vandenberg, Wagertech feedback — Operator &amp; Partner Record Pages doc, WAGERTECH Feedback PARTNER section: &quot;When Creating a NEW Partner you need a field to INPUT NAME.&quot;</p>",
