    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "10295",
          "body": "<p>Field is added to the record page but has visibility filter so it only shows on the new creation page and not twice on the created record page</p>",
          "created": "2026-09-08T14:58:08.185-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-08T14:58:08.185-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "10547",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"de06464c8d6b\"><strong>Bug:</strong> The &quot;show only when Name is blank&quot; rule fired the instant you typed anything — so the field vanished mid-typing, before you could even save.</p><p data-local-id=\"f8b9fb699f36\"><strong>Fix:</strong> Added an OR condition — show the field when Name is blank OR the record is new. &quot;New&quot; stays true for the whole creation flow, so the field only disappears after save, as originally intended.<br></p><figure data-local-id=\"b96b693df44d\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"675\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"7d621c49-e7f6-4a82-8eea-387a4bae6d8f\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-15 at 12.36.39 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><p data-local-id=\"c2f86741bba6\"><br></p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
